---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-brand-primary text-slate-300 py-16 mt-auto border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10">
    <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <img src="/assets/logo-main-transparent.png" alt="Phuket Tatili Logo" class="h-16 w-auto object-contain brightness-0 invert opacity-90" />
        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-white">Phuket <span class="text-brand-accent italic">Tatili</span></h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm font-light leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-6 text-slate-400">
        Tayland'ın en güzel adalarında unutulmaz anılar biriktirin. Özel turlar, VIP hizmetler ve 7/24 Türkçe rehberlik ile ayrıcalıklı bir tatil deneyimi.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-4 font-serif text-lg">Turlar & Hizmetler</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <li><a href="/turlar" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Tüm Turlar</a></li>
        <li><a href="/vip" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">VIP Hizmetler</a></li>
        <li><a href="/transferler" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Phuket Transferleri</a></li>
        <li><a href="/oteller" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Otel & Konaklama</a></li>
        <li><a href="/paketler" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Tatil Paketleri</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-4 font-serif text-lg">Kurumsal & İletişim</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <li><a href="/hakkimizda" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Hakkımızda</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Phuket Rehberi & Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/iletisim" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">İletişim</a></li>
        <li><a href="/gizlilik-ve-kosullar" class="hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">Gizlilik ve Koşullar</a></li>
        <li class="pt-2">
          <a href="https://wa.me/66828950665" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-accent font-semibold hover:underline">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path></svg>
            +66 82 895 0665
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-sm text-center text-slate-500">
    <p>&copy; {currentYear} Phuket Tatili. Tüm hakları saklıdır.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
